    <string name="tailcat_title" translatable="false">Tailcat</string>
    <string name="tailcat_settings_desc">Local ports carried to tailcat servers, without a VPN or a Tailscale account</string>
    <string name="tailcat_intro">Forwards ports on this device to a tailcat server over WireGuard — no VPN, no Tailscale account. Point an app at http://127.0.0.1:&lt;port&gt;. On the other machine, tailcat serve &lt;port&gt; prints the address to add here. Several connections run at once, one per server.</string>
